{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "978e6585-aee5-860d-9e82-58e218800a52",
  "created_at": "2026-01-26T12:07:19-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Vincent Conti",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:05:42-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:05:45-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good afternoon. My name is Vincent Conti. I have been practicing what I will say all morning, so please excuse me if I go slowly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:05:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, no rush at all, Mr. Conti. Take your time. What can I help you with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:06:00-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have an old refrigerator? In my house. It does not work anymore. I want to throw it away, but it is too big for the regular trash, I think?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:06:10-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, a refrigerator won't go out with your regular pickup. Large appliances like that need a separate arrangement. Is it still inside the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:06:19-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, still inside. I cannot lift it. My back is not good. Does the city take it away? Is there a fee?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:06:27-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually there's a bulky item pickup you schedule ahead, and appliances with cooling in them can have a charge, since they have to be handled special. I don't have the exact amount in front of me, so let me take your name and number and have someone from the department call you back with the details."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:06:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, okay. Vincent Conti. C-O-N-T-I. The number is 401-555-0184."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:06:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0184. And that's a refrigerator, correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:06:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, a refrigerator. Old, white color."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:06:56-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Since the weather's been messy with the snow and rain today, it may be tomorrow before someone gets back to you. Is that all right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:07:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is fine. No hurry. The refrigerator is not going anywhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:07:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "True enough. I'll pass the message along."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:07:13-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:07:16-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Conti. Take care."
    }
  ],
